================================================================================
                     CONTRIBUTORS AND THEIR ROLES
                          贡献者及其分工

This mod, DOCTOR M, is the collective work of a dedicated team of developers
who have contributed their creativity and effort over several years.

本模组 DOCTOR M 是一个专注的开发团队的集体作品，他们在数年间贡献了自己的创造力和努力。

---

### Project Lead / 项目负责人
- **Smallmoss**：项目发起人及主要维护者。
  Project founder and primary maintainer.

---

### Core Contributors / 核心贡献者

- **白桦树下的赤俄 (Kilin_Mus)**：参与「守望 (Watcher)」内饰概念设计及控制台纹理制作。
  Contributed to the "Watcher" interior concept and console texture design.

- **zhujianX_Offical**（后更名为 名游茶 / Asnit_PnQing）：创作了「烈火 (Fire)」、「霓虹 (Rainbow)」内饰。
  Created the "Fire" and "Rainbow" interiors.

- **斯格尔特 (Sigeerte)**（原 Sig. Erd）：创作了「疯恶 (Mad Evil)」、「斯格 (Sig)」、「恒朽 (Eternal Decay)」等内饰。
  Created the "Mad Evil", "Sig", "Eternal Decay", and other interiors.

- **慢跑者**：创作了「红石火把音速起子」模型。
  Created the "Redstone Torch Sonic Screwdriver" model.

---

### Additional Contributions / 其他贡献

- **[TC020](https://modrinth.com/user/TC020)**：创作了「时隙 (Rift)」内饰。
  Created the "Rift" interior.
- **[Tsinafs-Bcim](https://modrinth.com/user/Tsinafs-Bcim)**：提供了部分物品模型。
  Provided partial item models.
- **斯格尔特 (Sigeerte)、[asdjdfk](https://modrinth.com/user/asdjdfk)、T天玄X**：协助撰写了部分成就文本和物品提示文本。
  Assisted with writing some advancement texts and item tooltip texts.

---

### Special Thanks / 特别感谢

**在此特别感谢 [Amble Labs](https://modrinth.com/organization/amble-labs) 团队**，感谢他们创作了 **AIT (Adventures In Time)** 模组，为 DOCTOR M 提供了坚实的基础。
**Special thanks to the [Amble Labs](https://modrinth.com/organization/amble-labs) team** for creating the **AIT (Adventures In Time)** mod, which provided a solid foundation for DOCTOR M.

---

